--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 485d5921c3c3316468c06692dcaf7421, type: 3}
  m_Name: Monk_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueHolder
  lines:
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: Where.. Where am I?
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: Ah!! Another fool fell in
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: 'What... is this.. place..? '
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: It's an in-escapable Cave my child.
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: WHatt??.. NOO!! I need to get out of here.
  - Speaker: Monk
    lines: Okay... What about inescapable you dont understand?
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: It is an *inescapable cave*, no one ever escaped it...
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: With the sole exception of Gojo Satoru ofcourse..
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: How do you know that?
  - Speaker: 'Angry Monk:'
    lines: How do I know that???
  - Speaker: 'Angry Monk:'
    lines: Cause I am the only one who ever conquered this cave!!
  - Speaker: 'Angry Monk:'
    lines: I was the one who guided the only person who got out!!
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: Can you help me?
  - Speaker: 'Angry Monk:'
    lines: Ofcourse I can... you just have to ask nicely.
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: Please help me I really need to get out.
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: 'Okay, but to get out you have to master you emotions '
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: What does that mean?
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: You will understand that.
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: Now Go on, Use A & D or arrow  keys to move and Space to Jump.
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: Also beware of those spikes! they will send you back to me.
